# src/apps/android/app/src/androidTest/java

## Purpose
Provides the JVM package root for Android instrumentation-test sources in the application module.

## Contents
Contains namespace directories that lead to LumiNet device and emulator integration tests.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Consumed by Gradle's Android instrumentation source-set discovery and compiled against the app-under-test plus Android test APIs.

## Invariants
Only instrumentation-test sources belong here; production runtime code must remain under the main source set and package boundaries must mirror declared namespaces.